== ADR-0013 (Marcelo Fortes, design chat with ChatGPT): `if C then A else B`
== selects a value. Each branch is an expression; `else` is mandatory; it chains
== through `else if`; only the chosen branch is evaluated. It may span lines.
Module ConditionalExpression

Clamp(X Integer, Limit Integer) Integer :
    Return if X < 0 then -X else if X > Limit then Limit else X
;

Main :
    Limit := 10
    Result :=
        if Limit < 0
        then -Limit
        else if Limit > 5
             then 5
             else Limit
    Level := if Result >= 5 then "high" else "low"
    PutLn(Result, " ", Level, " ", Clamp(-3, 10), " ", Clamp(42, 10))
;
